    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "Advanced extension diagnostics",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 11,
            "content": {
              "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
              "style": "toolbar",
              "links": [
                {
                  "id": "ee2cfaa8-ffda-44f5-91c3-362c7b22f5bd",
                  "cellValue": "ShowExtensionDiagnostics",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "Show advanced extension diagnostics",
                  "subTarget": "true",
                  "style": "link"
                }
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "ShowExtensionDiagnostics",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
              "value": "true"
            },
            "name": "show_extension_diagnostics"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Reported extensions across Defender plans\nThis diagnostic inventory includes every returned extension name, including newer capabilities not in the eight-component Settings layout. Shared extensions keep their source plan and subplan. **Not reported** means the field is absent from Resource Graph, not disabled or successful. **Not applicable** is used only for extension fields on a plan with no reported extensions. Empty JSON objects (`{}`) and arrays (`[]`) remain visible as reported; a missing subplan is not guessed. Additional settings and operation details are complete JSON strings for inspection and export.\n\nRaw enablement is not effective coverage: check the pricing tier, entitlements, exclusions, operation details, and resource-level settings. In particular, a reported True value on a Free plan does not establish paid coverage. Plans without extension data remain visible. Resource Graph returns at most 1,000 rows per table; narrow subscriptions before exporting large inventories."
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "ShowExtensionDiagnostics",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "true"
            },
            "name": "extension_inventory_guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "title": "Raw subscription-level extension inventory",
              "query": "securityresources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.security/pricings\"\n| where id =~ strcat(\"/subscriptions/\", subscriptionId, \"/providers/Microsoft.Security/pricings/\", name)\n| extend hasExtensions = coalesce(array_length(properties.extensions), 0) > 0\n| mv-expand extension = iff(hasExtensions, properties.extensions, dynamic([{}]))\n| extend rawEnablement = tostring(extension.isEnabled), rawConfiguration = tostring(extension.additionalExtensionProperties),\n    rawOperation = tostring(extension.operationStatus), operationCode = tostring(extension.operationStatus.code)\n| project subscriptionId, Plan = name,\n    PricingTier = iff(isempty(tostring(properties.pricingTier)), \"Not reported\", tostring(properties.pricingTier)),\n    SubPlan = iff(isempty(tostring(properties.subPlan)), \"Not reported\", tostring(properties.subPlan)),\n    ExtensionName = case(not(hasExtensions), \"No extensions reported\", isempty(tostring(extension.name)), \"Name not reported\", tostring(extension.name)),\n    ReportedEnablement = case(not(hasExtensions), \"Not applicable\", isempty(rawEnablement), \"Not reported\", rawEnablement),\n    OperationCode = case(not(hasExtensions), \"Not applicable\", isempty(operationCode), \"Not reported\", operationCode),\n    Configuration = case(not(hasExtensions), \"Not applicable\", isempty(rawConfiguration), \"Not reported\", rawConfiguration),\n    OperationStatus = case(not(hasExtensions), \"Not applicable\", isempty(rawOperation), \"Not reported\", rawOperation)\n| order by Plan asc, ExtensionName asc, subscriptionId asc",
              "size": 0,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{subscriptions}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "noDataMessage": "No subscription-level pricing data was returned. Check scope and access; no data does not prove that extensions are absent.",
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true,
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "subscriptionId",
                    "formatter": 15,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "showIcon": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "subscriptionId",
                    "label": "Subscription"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Plan",
                    "label": "Source plan"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "PricingTier",
                    "label": "Pricing tier"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "SubPlan",
                    "label": "Subplan"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ExtensionName",
                    "label": "Extension API name"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ReportedEnablement",
                    "label": "Raw enablement"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "OperationCode",
                    "label": "Enablement operation"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Configuration",
                    "label": "Additional settings (JSON)"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "OperationStatus",
                    "label": "Operation details (JSON)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "ShowExtensionDiagnostics",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "true"
            },
            "name": "extension_inventory",
            "styleSettings": {
              "showBorder": true
